{"id":"otsutstvie","lemma":"отсутствие","pos":"noun","rank":1603,"glosses":["lack, absence"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b4/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%83%D1%82%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%81%D1%83%D1%82%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"отсутствия","plural":"отсутствия"},"examples":[{"text":"Моя мать умерла в моё отсутствие.","en":"My mother died during my absence.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null]},{"text":"Я вернулся домой после двух лет отсутствия.","en":"I returned home after an absence of two years.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to return","l":"вернуться"},{"g":"home"},{"g":"after"},{"g":"two","l":"два"},{"g":"year","l":"год"},null]},{"text":"Никто не заметил твоего отсутствия.","en":"No one noticed your absence.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to notice","l":"заметить"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null]},{"text":"Он оправдывал своё отсутствие.","en":"He gave an excuse about why he had been absent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/653919","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"За моё отсутствие многое изменилось.","en":"Much had changed during my absence.","words":[{"g":"behind / for"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"many things"},{"g":"to change","l":"измениться"}]}]}